tooltip.kamitesque.memory.4.0=§6§o...the slaughter goes without stopping. The flashes of spells...
tooltip.kamitesque.memory.4.1=§6§o...and §k???§r§6§o flicker here all day long...
tooltip.kamitesque.memory.4.2=§6§o...It doesn't matter who's left standing...

tooltip.kamitesque.memory.5.0=§6§o...when I look up at the scorched wasteland...
tooltip.kamitesque.memory.5.1=§6§o...my §k???§r§6§o bleeds. If anyone remains after us...
